the handling of the \\(|p+q|=1\\) case in the bound, and the claim that only three specific sunny lines can attain the bound for any odd \\(k\\)\u2014are not rigorously justified.  These constitute **Justification Gaps** rather than fatal logical errors, because the final answer remains correct."
